  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 22 01 0D 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 47 11}果然，出现的还是这种珠子……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_750.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 22 01 0E 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_750.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞伊丽莎白凝视着珠子……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_750.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 0E 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}凝视这颗珠子时，\n总有一种奇妙的感觉包围着我。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_750.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3B 11}若要形容的话……对了，是喜悦。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_750.bf.json:3:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}让人想起那些美好的恋人，\n置身于安定与幸福之中……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_750.bf.json:3:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3A 11}决定了。\n就将这颗珠子命名为{F2 01 03 01}“婚姻之珠”{F2 01 01 01}吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_750.bf.json:3:4",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 0F 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我觉得是个相当不错的名字。\n不接受任何异议。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_750.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞伊丽莎白将{F2 01 03 01}“婚姻之珠”{F2 01 01 01}\n　收进了口袋……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_750.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2D 11}那么，关于报酬。\n正如之前所说，是件好东西。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_750.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E8 0E}想必能帮上您的忙。\n还请收下。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_750.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞收到了{F4 45 04 01 00 00 01 01}！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
